{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……那之後。", "text_idx": 130, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪過了好一會才終於能自由行動……", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那邊還有滴下來的！給我全部擦乾淨！不准留下任何痕跡！」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7476", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「居然在社團教室裡愛愛了，絕對、絕對不可以被發現！」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7477", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道……！」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起清理自己的身體，我們更拼命打掃社團教室。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為剛才的性愛實在太激烈，各種液體飛散得到處都是。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且紗凪說的對，我們絕對不能讓社團的大家發現這件事。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「紗凪、紗凪！妳的胯下有東西滴下來了！滴在地板上！」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……根本掃不乾淨嘛！新吾射太多了，你到底射了多少啊！」", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7478", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，就是『全部』而已……」", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說我到底搾了多少啊！我到底多喜歡新吾啦～～～～～～～～！」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7479", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……喜歡到沒有極限？」", "text_idx": 136, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……嗯。」", "text_idx": 154, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7480", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈。」", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸嘿、嘿嘿嘿……」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7481", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「現在不是聊天的時候了！總之打掃！先打掃再說！」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7482", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「社團教室讓我掃就行了，紗凪那個，嗯，先清理好自己比較好……」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……的確。那我們都先冷靜下來穿好制服吧。」", "text_idx": 144, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7483", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是，不能一直裸體……」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "於是我們清理身體，穿上制服。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……紗凪……」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾，你應該沒有偷看我擦身體穿制服，然後又變大吧？」", "text_idx": 143, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7484", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有！我沒有看！而且我今天已經全部射光了！」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可是新吾你真的很喜歡我，感覺好像又會復活……可能性……」", "text_idx": 147, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7485", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 133, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「居然有！？居然有喔！？你到底，到底！」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7486", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我無法堅定的說沒有可能，的確是沒有極限……」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好、好吧……如果那樣就再一次……」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7487", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「結果我也是啊！一樣嘛！我們根本就是一對沒有極限的情侶嘛！」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7488", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好像會讓性愛和打掃永遠重複下去。」", "text_idx": 140, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到早上吧……然後被美羽學姊發現……」", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7489", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「紗凪全身都虛軟無力的狀態。」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾則是對著那樣的我又變大了。」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7490", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……努力打掃吧。」", "text_idx": 135, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……也對……」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7491", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「畢竟新吾變大的時候是只屬於我的……」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7492", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？問題是那個嗎！？」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算是美羽學姊我也不會讓她看的！」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7493", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳的心意我很高興，但現在先放一邊吧！冷靜一點紗凪，冷靜！」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「誰能冷靜啊！那邊我已經擦過了，結果新吾的精液又從肚子裡流出來！」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7494", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道了、我知道了啦！總之冷靜下來，來，紗凪──」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……雖然花了很多時間，但我們總算把社團教室打掃乾淨，離開了學校。", "text_idx": 131, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……要是結果因為氣味被發現的話就太悲慘了。」", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7495", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「已經開窗換氣過了，我想應該沒問題……」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好吧，反正能做的都做了，應該沒事。」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7496", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算真的被發現，嘻嘻嘻，新吾也會負責任嘛。」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7497", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我會努力。」", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂，不是那樣吧！你這時應該說『一起負責吧』才對啦！」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7498", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪從旁邊撞我。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後就這樣把臉頰貼在我的手臂上。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不可能被發現的啦。畢竟那間社團教室總是有各種味道。」", "text_idx": 134, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7499", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這麼說也對。」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉～難得的親親熱熱的餘韻，居然沒辦法兩個人好好享受……」", "text_idx": 153, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7500", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「畢竟是那種場所……今後找事後可以安心放鬆的場所吧。」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔、嗯……但是、那個、呃、比起那個……」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7501", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯嗯。」", "text_idx": 138, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7502", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紅撲撲的臉蛋撒嬌地蹭了蹭。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後抬起眼眸看我。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……嗯，說的也對。今天的份現在來做吧……一點點也好……」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7503", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我抱住她。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪閉上眼睛，抬起頭。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟剛才的眼神一樣，我立刻就理解了意思。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、啾……嗯……」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7504", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嘴唇輕輕地碰觸她。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……紗凪可愛地顫抖起來。", "text_idx": 129, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿……光是這樣，『喜歡』就在全身擴散的感覺……」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7505", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為還留有餘韻嗎……」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7506", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我吻了妳，但妳還能站著喔。」", "text_idx": 141, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……真的耶！沒有像以前那樣腿軟！」", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7507", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼呢……啊，根本不必想吧。」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7508", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？抱歉，為什麼？」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾不懂嗎？」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7509", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不好意思……」", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈……那本小姐紗凪就教教你吧。」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7510", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯♪」", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7511", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪撲到我懷裡，我正以為她要主動吻我……", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然是因為……身體已經學會更厲害的事情了呀……♪」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7512", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 133, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「懂了嗎？」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7513", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……噗，啊哈哈，說的也是……嗯！」", "text_idx": 139, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀！？喂、喂！不要突然把我抱起來……！」", "text_idx": 148, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7514", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我可不想被突然就親我的紗凪這樣說啊。」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「照你這樣說那新吾不是更──噗，啊哈哈！沒完沒了呢……啊哈哈哈……」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn7515", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──２月１４日，情人節。", "text_idx": 132, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "對我們來說值得紀念的日子又增加了。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
